      "id": "s8",
      "short": "Recap",
      "title": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "body": "• Zoom — HLD: Whole system; LLD: One component\n• Parts — HLD: Services, stores, queues; LLD: Classes, tables, states\n• Decides — HLD: What talks to what, where data lives; LLD: How each part works inside\n• Changes — HLD: Rarely, with agreement; LLD: Often, within a team\n\nThis course works at the HLD level and dips into LLD where a decision depends on it. LLD — object-oriented design, design patterns — is a subject of its own.",
